<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>NCT API Center</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background-color: #050505;
            color: #e6e6e6;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            text-align: center;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
        }
        h1 {
            color: #ccff00;
            font-size: 4rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.5);
        }
        p { font-size: 1.2rem; color: #888; max-width: 600px; line-height: 1.6; }
        
        .btn-group { margin-top: 40px; display: flex; gap: 20px; }
        
        .btn {
            padding: 15px 40px;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 50px;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }
        .btn-primary {
            background-color: #ccff00; color: #000;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(204, 255, 0, 0.3);
        }
        .btn-primary:hover { transform: scale(1.05); background: #fff; }
        
        .btn-secondary {
            border: 2px solid #333; color: #fff;
        }
        .btn-secondary:hover { border-color: #ccff00; color: #ccff00; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>NCT API CENTER</h1>
    <p>
        Layanan penyedia data terbuka untuk Member & Unit NCT. <br>
        Silakan Login atau Generate API Key untuk mengakses database kami.
    </p>

    <div class="btn-group">
        <a href="/developer/login" class="btn btn-primary">LOGIN </a>
        <a href="/developer/register" class="btn btn-secondary">REGISTER</a>
    </div>
    
    <div style="margin-top: 50px; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #444;">
        &copy; 2026 NCTverse System. Secured API Access.
    </div>

</body>
</html>